  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "（探偵の朝は早い。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "（起き抜けに一杯のコーヒーとサニーサイドアップを摂り、寝ぼけた脳を叩き起こして、）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "（飼い猫にキャットフードをやる時間が必要だからだ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "（猫の世話をして、一時間ほど朝刊を読み……そして、ようやく事務所を開くのだ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「……なんて、かっこいいことを言ってみたはいいけど。ああもう、どうしてこんなことになってるんだろう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「……今月はまだ、一件も依頼が来てないし、このままだと廃業になっちゃうよ～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「先代から探偵の仕事を引き継いで、まだほんの数か月と経ってないのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「先月、依頼があったときも、猫一匹探せやしなかったし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「うう、やっぱりわたしって、探偵向いてないのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「なんて、落ち込んでたら来るはずの依頼人も来なくなっちゃうよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「せめて、安心して事務所に入ってもらえるように、お掃除でもしておこうかな……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「ええと、はたきはどこに置いてあったっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「たしか、押し入れに……あったあった♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「これでホコリをちゃんと払って、ついでに拭き掃除もしてぴかぴかにしちゃおうっと……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたしには、先代みたいな信頼感はまだないけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「依頼してくれたひとが安心できるように、きれいな事務所を心掛けちゃおう……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「……あれっ。博物館のチケットが本の間に挟まってる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「今日からはじまる特別展の招待券みたいだね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「そっか。忘れてたけど、この博物館の館長さんと先代が懇意にしてたんだっけ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「なんでも、以前に怪盗『鼠小僧』の事件を解決したとかで？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あのときの活躍を見てたから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたしも先代の助手として、怪盗を捕まえられるような名探偵になろうと誓ったんだよね、懐かしいなぁ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「だけど、今の平和なキミサキシティには、怪盗なんて現れないんだよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「なくしものを見つけるとか、浮気調査とか、そういう地味なお仕事ばかりだもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「もうすこし、ロマンのある仕事がしたいなぁ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「って、仕事がひとつもないわたしが言えた義理じゃないけどね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-detective",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-detective_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「ノックの音が聞こえたけど、もしかしてお客さんかな……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
